title: "Measuring ROI of $1/Day Experiments: Small-Budget Testing Done Right"
description: "How to run and measure tiny ad experiments: what to track, how long to run, when a $1 test tells you something real — and when it's just noise."
date: 2026-09-23
author: "FlexSpot Team"
