title: "Seasonal Marketing Calendar for Dubai Small Businesses (Beyond Ramadan)"
description: "A year-round seasonal marketing calendar for Dubai brands: National Day, back-to-school, summer slowdowns, festive seasons, and how small budgets win each one."
date: 2026-09-23
