title: "Nobody Clicks Banner Ads Anymore. Here's What Replaced Them"
description: "Banner ad click-through rates fell below 0.1% years ago. Small brands stopped renting rectangles and started competing on live leaderboards, where attention is a game — not wallpaper."
date: 2026-09-24
